				<div class="col-md-12 fade-up">
					<h1>Infrastructure that Inspires Excellence</h1>
					<p>In order to achieve its ambition of being a world-class education provider, Chitkara&nbsp;University is committed to significant enhancement of its facilities and buildings, essential for world-class research and all-round development of students. The University has an extremely modern and state&#8209;of&#8209;the&#8209;art infrastructure that goes a long way in facilitating a number of services for the students as well as the staff members.</p>
