									<h2 class="headTitle">Academic Blocks</h2>
									<p>The academic blocks bring together state&#8209;of&#8209;the&#8209;art classrooms, department specific laboratories, dedicated libraries, studios, and amphitheatres to create a comprehensive learning environment. Classrooms are equipped with modern audio-visual systems and digital teaching technologies that support engaging lectures, presentations, and discussions. Complemented by specialised facilities and subject-focused learning spaces, these blocks encourage exploration, collaboration, and deeper academic engagement. Together, they support both theoretical understanding and hands-on learning.</p>
								</div>
