										</div>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="academicLeft">
									<h2 class="headTitleW">Central Library</h2>
									<p>The libraries across the campuses serve as vibrant knowledge hubs, offering spacious reading halls, periodical sections, group discussion rooms, and dedicated zones for accessing digital databases. They house an extensive collection of resources across multiple formats, including books, journals, multimedia, and global research databases. Skilled library professionals support students and faculty in navigating these resources, enabling them to conduct effective research, discovery, and academic inquiry.</p>
									
