									<h2 class="headTitle">Residential Facilities</h2>
									<p>At Chitkara&nbsp;University, you will be among students from across the country living in residences that feel like a home away from home. Separate facilities for boys and girls, caring wardens, and strong security ensure a comfortable stay, allowing students to focus on academics. Internet access and Subscriber Trunk Dialling (STD) keep students connected with family and friends, while common rooms with TVs, indoor games, and other amenities offer space to relax and&nbsp;unwind. </p>
								</div>
