									<h2 class="headTitle">Sports Complex & Facilities</h2>
									<p>Students are encouraged to enjoy sports on campus as well as participate in various sports competitions. We inspire students to follow the camaraderie and spirit of adventure through sports. Outdoor sports facilities include Athletics, Basketball, Cricket, Football, Tennis, Pickleball, Volleyball. Indoor sports facilities include:</p>
									
									<ul class="sports-list">
									  <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">sports_basketball</span> Basketball Courts</li>
									  <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">sports_volleyball</span> Volleyball Courts</li>
									  <li><span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">badminton</span> Badminton Courts</li>
