								<h2 class="headTitle">Cafeteria & Food Court</h2>
								<p>Whether it’s breakfast, lunch, dinner, or a late-night snack, the University Food Court offers something to satisfy every craving. The dining hall features a wide variety of cuisines. Chitkara&nbsp;University offers a healthy and sustainability conscious on-campus menu with nutritious and appetising options. Across the campus, students have access to numerous choices, from coffee and snack outlets to pizzeria, ensuring both variety and convenience throughout the day.</p>
