									</div>
									<h2 class="headTitleW">Auditoriums & Seminar Halls</h2>
									<p>The spacious, amphitheatre-style classrooms in the University provide the most conducive atmosphere for dynamic and focused discussions. They have been designed to bring together analysis with action and are augmented with integrated audio visual teaching aids for lectures, presentation, etc. Special sessions and classes are also held on business etiquettes, negotiation skills, effective communication, leadership, teamwork and analytical skills.</p>
									<p>Contemporary auditoriums and seminar halls serve as dynamic venues for intellectual exchange and academic engagement. Equipped with advanced acoustics and modern presentation technologies, these spaces host lectures, conferences, expert talks, and student forums, enabling dialogue, collaboration, and the vibrant exchange of ideas across the University community.</p>
									
									<ul style="display:none;" class="auditoriumsList">
									  <li><h4>1K+</h4><p>SEATING CAPACITY</p></li>
									  <li><h5>5+</h5><p>HALLS</p>
									  </li>
									</ul>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
        </div>

