        <img src="https://www.chitkara.edu.in/wp-content/themes/chitkara/images/2026/about/Capgemini-new.webp" alt="Capgemini Lab">
		<div class="cardBtm">
			<h3>Capgemini Code Experience Center</h3>
			<p>An on-campus coding hub that provides students with practical software engineering experience through live projects and industry mentored bootcamps.</p>
