									<h2 class="headTitle">Chitkara Innovation Incubator</h2>
									<p>A platform dedicated to nurturing entrepreneurship and venture creation. The incubator supports students, innovators, and early-stage founders in developing ideas into viable startups. Through mentorship, industry connections, and strategic guidance, innovators refine business models, build sustainable ventures, and prepare solutions for real-world markets. Encouraging collaboration and entrepreneurial thinking, it enables emerging founders to transform promising ideas into scalable enterprises with meaningful impact.</p>
