								<h2 class="headTitle">Medical & Health Centre</h2>
								<p>A healthy body makes for a healthy mind. In order to ensure your well-being, Chitkara&nbsp;University has tie-ups with renowned hospitals to take care of any kind of emergency. At Chitkara&nbsp;University, you will be covered by a comprehensive medical insurance to meet all kinds of exigencies.</p>
								<ul class="medicalServicesList">
									<li>
										<span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">stethoscope</span>
										<h3>General Consultations</h3>
										<p>Qualified doctor and nursing staff on campus</p>
									</li>

									<li>
										<span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">local_shipping</span>
										<h3>Emergency Ambulance</h3>
										<p>Round-the-clock ambulance service</p>
									</li>

									<li>
										<span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">local_hospital</span>
										<h3>Hospital Tie-ups</h3>
										<p>Nearby hospitals for specialised care</p>
									</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
